nt": 3, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 17}, "text": "What can a researcher in an overworked laboratory do to take care of themselves and their lab-mates, and how should they navigate medical disclosure?\n\nhttps://t.co/S15oJDceTq", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2113648854809649633"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113648115362463744"]}, "author_id": "86626845", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:06:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113648289639960836"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 104, "id": "27013292", "start": 94, "username": "TheLancet"}], "urls": [{"description": "Having immersed myself in death and dying for well over a decade—I wrote a book, The Way We Die Now (2016), and was later a member of the Lancet Commission on The Value of Death—it was inevitable that I would become interested in the flip side of that subject: the world of longevity. I use the word “world” because it has so many constituent parts: science, industry, economics, medicine, philosophy, religion, and politics.", "display_url": "thelancet.com/journals/lance…", "end": 129, "expanded_url": "https://www.thelancet.com/journals/lancet/article/PIIS0140-6736(26)02112-4/fulltext", "images": [{"height": 300, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113648295172329473/StibTCrr?format=png&name=orig", "width": 300}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113648295172329473/StibTCrr?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 106, "status": 200, "title": "Longevity is a political concern", "unwound_url": "https://www.thelancet.com/journals/lancet/article/PIIS0140-6736(26)02112-4/abstract", "url": "https://t.co/fOIMW9qxeX"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/l7L4drjYKY", "end": 153, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2113648289639960836/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113648115362463744", "start": 130, "url": "https://t.co/l7L4drjYKY"}]}, "id": "2113648289639960836", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 166, "impression_count": 37029, "like_count": 406, "quote_count": 30, "reply_count": 57, "retweet_count": 97}, "text": "\"The longevity industry is a goldrush without gold.\"\nand other strong words about 2 delusions @TheLancet \nhttps://t.co/fOIMW9qxeX https://t.co/l7L4drjYKY", "url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2113648289639960836"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113646749390606336"]}, "author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:00:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113646751529701866"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 27, "start": 15, "tag": "optogenetic"}], "mentions": [{"end": 242, "id": "137777298", "start": 232, "username": "scisignal"}], "urls": [{"description": "Optogenetically coupling GIRK channel activation to an opsin switches G protein signaling.", "display_url": "scim.ag/4eImxxk", "end": 266, "expanded_url": "https://scim.ag/4eImxxk", "images": [{"height": 550, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112610490480496640/TpmxG7W_?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 715}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112610490480496640/TpmxG7W_?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 243, "status": 200, "title": "Improving optogenetic control over Gi/o-coupled receptor signaling by optimized GIRK channel expression", "unwound_url": "https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/scisignal.adw4374?utm_campaign=ScienceMagazine&utm_medium=ownedSocial&utm_source=twitter", "url": "https://t.co/o23pnsZscd"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/AoW5XTbz9U", "end": 290, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2113646751529701866/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113646749390606336", "start": 267, "url": "https://t.co/AoW5XTbz9U"}]}, "id": "2113646751529701866", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 24, "impression_count": 15793, "like_count": 142, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 26}, "text": "A new slate of #optogenetic tools enables scientists to finely control G protein signaling in excitable cells—providing a flexible method that might also be used therapeutically for disorders that disrupt the excitability of cells. @SciSignal https://t.co/o23pnsZscd https://t.co/AoW5XTbz9U", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2113646751529701866"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:58:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113646210653315076"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The proposal would restrict U.S. investments in Chinese biotechs, but still allows licensing deals.", "display_url": "trib.al/55k3Afy", "end": 145, "expanded_url": "https://trib.al/55k3Afy", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113633301332140032/VuADMW4w?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113633301332140032/VuADMW4w?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 122, "status": 200, "title": "Treasury proposes major restrictions to U.S. investment in Chinese biotech sector", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/10/23/new-china-biotech-limits-coins-act-proposal-us-pharma-reaction/?utm_campaign=twitter_organic&utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=social", "url": "https://t.co/npeyC5kKzP"}]}, "id": "2113646210653315076", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1544, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "A new Treasury Department proposal would restrict U.S. investments in Chinese biotechs, but still allows licensing deals. https://t.co/npeyC5kKzP", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2113646210653315076"}, {"author_id": "860158302", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:56:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113645760554135986"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "To invade red blood cells, the deadly protists create temporary molecular portals that disappear behind them — doors we can now see in fine detail.", "display_url": "quantamagazine.org/malaria-parasi…", "end": 266, "expanded_url": "https://www.quantamagazine.org/malaria-parasite-caught-in-the-act-of-breaking-and-entering-20261023/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113645763972481024/y5u7T7ny?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113645763972481024/y5u7T7ny?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 243, "status": 200, "title": "Malaria Parasite Caught in the Act of Breaking and Entering | Quanta Magazine", "unwound_url": "https://www.quantamagazine.org/malaria-parasite-caught-in-the-act-of-breaking-and-entering-20261023/", "url": "https://t.co/JyPSUT29CU"}]}, "id": "2113645760554135986", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 6797, "like_count": 39, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "To invade red blood cells, malaria parasites create a temporary molecular portal that lets it slip into the cell — and then disappears behind it. Researchers have finally detailed the proteins that let it break in without tripping the alarms. https://t.co/JyPSUT29CU", "url": "https://x.com/QuantaMagazine/status/2113645760554135986"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:44:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113642671667392816"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "It seems everyone has a hot take on the new Elizabeth Holmes documentary, \"You Can See Everything.\" STAT reporters went to see the film — here's their review.", "display_url": "statnews.com/2026/10/23/exp…", "end": 113, "expanded_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/10/23/explain-appeal-elizabeth-holmes-doc-status-report/", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113578589996146688/bZ2Vzwbm?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113578589996146688/bZ2Vzwbm?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 90, "status": 200, "title": "STAT reporters react to the new Elizabeth Holmes documentary", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/10/23/explain-appeal-elizabeth-holmes